    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Rev Up for Nostalgia with Retro Racers!</i></strong> \ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca8 <br><br>Dive into the world of <strong>Retro Racers</strong>, where classic cars and thrilling races come together! Choose from a variety of vintage cars, customise your wheels, and race through progressively challenging tracks. <br><br>Whether you\u2019re competing solo or in split-screen with a friend, Retro Racers offers endless excitement. \ud83c\udfc1\ud83d\udd25 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split-Screen Multiplayer</strong> \ud83c\udfae <br>\u00a0 \u00a0Race against a friend or take on AI in solo mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wide Range of Retro Cars</strong> \ud83d\ude99 <br>\u00a0 \u00a0Pick from a selection of beautifully designed classic cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Customisable Wheels</strong> \ud83d\udede <br>\u00a0 \u00a0Switch up your wheels to fit your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Progressive Level Unlocking</strong> \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <br>\u00a0 \u00a0Unlock new tracks as you race through each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Car Upgrades</strong> \ud83d\udd27 <br>\u00a0 \u00a0Boost your car\u2019s speed, handling, and more to stay ahead. <br><br>Experience the fast-paced fun of vintage racing with <strong>Retro Racers</strong>. Get ready to hit the gas and race to victory! \ud83c\udfc6\ud83d\ude80</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Rev Up for Nostalgia with Retro Racers!</i></strong> \ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca8 <br><br>Dive into the world of <strong>Retro Racers</strong>, where classic cars and thrilling races come together! Choose from a variety of vintage cars, customise your wheels, and race through progressively challenging tracks. <br><br>Whether you\u2019re competing solo or in split-screen with a friend, Retro Racers offers endless excitement. \ud83c\udfc1\ud83d\udd25 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split-Screen Multiplayer</strong> \ud83c\udfae <br>\u00a0 \u00a0Race against a friend or take on AI in solo mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wide Range of Retro Cars</strong> \ud83d\ude99 <br>\u00a0 \u00a0Pick from a selection of beautifully designed classic cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Customisable Wheels</strong> \ud83d\udede <br>\u00a0 \u00a0Switch up your wheels to fit your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Progressive Level Unlocking</strong> \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <br>\u00a0 \u00a0Unlock new tracks as you race through each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Car Upgrades</strong> \ud83d\udd27 <br>\u00a0 \u00a0Boost your car\u2019s speed, handling, and more to stay ahead. <br><br>Experience the fast-paced fun of vintage racing with <strong>Retro Racers</strong>. Get ready to hit the gas and race to victory! \ud83c\udfc6\ud83d\ude80</p></li></ul>",
